OL,3,CMan jailed for 'wholly disgusting and
OL,4,Cwicked' images of young children
OL,6,FA 62-year-old man has been jailed
OL,7,Fafter pleading guilty to all ten
OL,8,Fcharges of possessing indecent images
OL,9,Fof children.
OL,11,FPatrick Wayne Devaney's offences were
OL,12,Fdescribed by Guernsey Magistrate Court
OL,13,FJudge Russell Finch as "wholly
OL,14,Fdisgusting and wicked" as he sentenced
OL,15,Fhim to two years in prison.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/4
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
