FL,360,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1785849529
OL,3,CMan jailed for 'wholly disgusting and
OL,4,Cwicked' images of young children
OL,6,FThe convicted paedophile will also be
OL,7,Fplaced on the sex offenders' register
OL,8,Ffor five years and face a three-year
OL,9,Fprobation order, which restricts his
OL,10,Fuse of a computer and him being around
OL,11,Fchildren without supervision.
OL,13,FJudge Finch said these cases are
OL,14,F"remarkably unpleasant" and the
OL,15,Fvictims in this instance are "young
OL,16,Fchildren".
OL,18,FDevaney was arrested at his home in
OL,19,FGuernsey on 10 November 2025 and three
OL,20,Fdevices were seized, where 135
OL,21,Findecent images were found.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/4
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
