PN,35903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1785849529
OL,3,CMan jailed for 'wholly disgusting and
OL,4,Cwicked' images of young children
OL,6,FThis included 33 of the most serious
OL,7,FCategory A pictures, 30 Category B and
OL,8,F72 Category C.
OL,10,FDevaney also had a specialist web
OL,11,Fbrowser which he used to try and avoid
OL,12,Fdetection.
OL,14,FThe defendant admitted he needs help
OL,15,Fand said he takes full responsbility
OL,16,Ffor his crimes.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/4
