CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1785849529
OL,3,CMan jailed for 'wholly disgusting and
OL,4,Cwicked' images of young children
OL,6,FAt the hearing, there was a debate
OL,7,Faround sentencing powers in the
OL,8,Fisland's Magistrate's Court - as
OL,9,Fjudges can only impose limited jail
OL,10,Fterms.
OL,12,FIn response to these concerns, Judge
OL,13,FFinch decided to add on the probation
OL,14,Forder.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/4
